{"team":"SEA","col":"#69BE28","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":59.5,"adot":7.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>No Fixed Address</h2><p>There's no bell-cow to bank on \u2014 the lead back sees just <strong>50%</strong> of carries (league ~59%), a committee that caps any one back's ceiling and makes their rushing props matchup- and script-dependent.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Jaxon Smith-Njigba</strong> \u2014 <strong>29% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Inside the 20 they lean run-heavy, passing <strong>47%</strong> of the time, funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Jadarian Price</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 A Balanced Defense</h2><p>They lock down opposing WR1s \u2014 just 48 rec yds/game (vs ~58); fade receiving props there.</p><p><strong>Soft against opposing tight ends</strong> \u2014 42 rec yds/game (vs ~35). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They surrender <strong>106 rushing</strong> and <strong>226 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 42% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs).</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Sam Darnold","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":9,"props":{"Comp":19.02,"Att":29.55,"Pass Yds":224.37,"Pass TD":1.43,"INT":0.65,"Rush Yds":8.69},"d":{"completions":19.02,"attempts":29.55,"pass_yards":224.37,"pass_td":1.43,"interceptions":0.65,"rush_att":2.38,"rush_yards":8.69}}],"RB":[{"name":"Jadarian Price","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":28,"props":{"Rush Att":16.03,"Rush Yds":68.31,"Tgt":3.2,"Rec":2.53,"Rec Yds":18.74},"d":{"rush_att":16.03,"rush_yards":68.31,"targets":3.2,"receptions":2.53,"rec_yards":18.74,"rec_td":0.07}},{"name":"George Holani","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":15,"props":{"Rush Att":4.05,"Rush Yds":15.21,"Tgt":2.73,"Rec":1.88,"Rec Yds":13.32},"d":{"rush_att":4.05,"rush_yards":15.21,"targets":2.73,"receptions":1.88,"rec_yards":13.32,"rec_td":0.05}},{"name":"Emanuel Wilson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":21,"props":{"Rush Att":7.5,"Rush Yds":32.3,"Tgt":2.63,"Rec":1.79,"Rec Yds":12.09},"d":{"rush_att":7.5,"rush_yards":32.3,"targets":2.63,"receptions":1.79,"rec_yards":12.09,"rec_td":0.05}}],"WR":[{"name":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":33,"props":{"Tgt":12.65,"Rec":9.01,"Rec Yds":112.98,"Rec TD":0.4},"d":{"targets":12.65,"receptions":9.01,"rec_yards":112.98,"rec_td":0.4}},{"name":"Rashid Shaheed","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":12,"props":{"Tgt":4.5,"Rec":2.83,"Rec Yds":41.4,"Rec TD":0.13},"d":{"targets":4.5,"receptions":2.83,"rec_yards":41.4,"rec_td":0.13}},{"name":"Cooper Kupp","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":29,"props":{"Tgt":8.47,"Rec":6.09,"Rec Yds":74.9,"Rec TD":0.34},"d":{"targets":8.47,"receptions":6.09,"rec_yards":74.9,"rec_td":0.34}}],"TE":[{"name":"AJ Barner","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":21,"props":{"Tgt":4.98,"Rec":3.83,"Rec Yds":36.59,"Rec TD":0.24},"d":{"targets":4.98,"receptions":3.83,"rec_yards":36.59,"rec_td":0.24}},{"name":"Eric Saubert","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Tgt":3.98,"Rec":2.4,"Rec Yds":19.88,"Rec TD":0.12},"